3. Not bundled
--------------

3.1  Modules provided by the OpenCloud host
-------------------------------------------

The extension is a module-federation remote. These modules are declared as
shared singletons with `import: false` by `@opencloud-eu/extension-sdk` (see
`node_modules/@opencloud-eu/extension-sdk/dist/extension-sdk.js`, the
`externalModules` list) and are additionally forced into the host-provided share
map by the `alignOpenCloudSharedVersions()` plugin in this repo's
`vite.config.ts`. They are loaded from the OpenCloud web host at runtime and are
therefore not part of this distribution:

  vue, luxon, pinia, vue3-gettext,
  @opencloud-eu/web-pkg, @opencloud-eu/web-pkg/editor,
  @opencloud-eu/web-client, @opencloud-eu/web-client/graph,
  @opencloud-eu/web-client/graph/generated, @opencloud-eu/web-client/ocs,
  @opencloud-eu/web-client/sse, @opencloud-eu/web-client/webdav

Verification: a build of this repository contains 0 modules from `vue`,
`vue3-gettext` or `@opencloud-eu/web-pkg`/`-web-client`; the generated
`dist/js/_virtual_mf-localSharedImportMap*.mjs` lists them with
`shareConfig.import: false`. Their licenses come with the OpenCloud web host
itself.

